      "lily::“This is a terrible idea,” she says, not moving a centimetre. “I run this entire household. I am supposed to be the sensible one.”",
      "player::You're allowed to be something else for one night.",
      "lily::“One night.” She turns the phrase over like she's checking it for loopholes. Then, quieter: “Alright.”",
