      "noelle::“People think being observant is about other people. It isn't, mostly.” She turns a pen slowly between her fingers. “It's about staying a step ahead of the room so nothing lands on you that you didn't see coming. It's a defensive skill. I'm very defensive.”",
      "player::That sounds tiring.",
