      { speaker: "narrator", text: "She sinks down onto you, knees either side, head nearly against the canvas, and moves like a woman who has decided the low ceiling is not going to be the thing that stops her.", video: "chloe/action4/chloecowgirl.4.mp4" },
      "chloe::“If this tent comes down on us I will actually die of embarrassment before I die of exposure,” she says, not slowing down at all. “Please don't tell anyone at the Ashgrove. Please. I will never live down a tent.”"
