  /* ---------------- Jade q8: four columns ----------------
     The method is the whole of her. Eleven towns run off four columns —
     coach, room, work, out — and it has never once failed her, because it
     was never designed to do anything except get her cleanly through a
     place and cleanly out of it again.

     So this is the quest where the method gets asked to do a thing it has
     no heading for. She is looking at rooms in a town with about four of
     them going, and she is timing the exits in all of them, and she can
     hear herself doing it. */
