  /* ---------------- Noelle q9: her own column ----------------
     Q7 was her handing over a document about him and calling it the
     thing she does. Q8 was the empty page. This one closes both: she
     has built another spreadsheet, she braces for it to be the failure
     again — and it isn't, because for the first time in nine years the
     document is about her.

     The point of the scene, and the reason action4 works at all, is that
     nothing gets taken away from her here. She does not have to stop
     being precise. The precision was never the defect; it had simply
     never once been pointed at herself. She leaves this scene intending
     to write down what she wants, which is exactly what she walks in
     holding in the next one. */
